<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="grad" style="margin:.2em 0">Data Deletion Instructions</h1>

      <div style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted,#555)">
        <p>CRM PROSHOP respects the privacy of its users and provides a simple process for requesting the deletion of personal data.</p>

        <p>If you would like to request deletion of personal data associated with CRM PROSHOP, please send an email to:</p>

        <p style="font-weight:600"><a href="mailto:soporte@proshop.lat">soporte@proshop.lat</a></p>

        <p>Use the subject:</p>

        <p style="font-style:italic">Data Deletion Request</p>

        <p>Please include enough information for us to identify the account or data related to your request.</p>

        <p>After receiving the request, we will verify the information and delete the applicable personal data from our systems, except where retention is required by law or necessary for legitimate security, fraud prevention, or legal compliance purposes.</p>

        <p>We will process valid deletion requests within a reasonable period of time.</p>

        <p>CRM PROSHOP is operated by Grafi and is used to manage business leads and customer communications through authorized Meta and WhatsApp Business integrations.</p>
      </div>

      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
